flowchart LR
    R["Ravi &mdash; Employee<br/><i>Altitude: Consumption</i><br/>Supplies own data;<br/>trusts the output<br/><b>Fear: paid wrong / unseen</b>"]
    M["Meera &mdash; HR generalist<br/><i>Altitude: Input</i><br/>Feeds clean, reconciled<br/>inputs; chases dates<br/><b>Fear: blame / escalation</b>"]
    S["Suresh &mdash; Payroll officer<br/><i>Altitude: Production</i><br/>Produces the correct,<br/>portal-ready file<br/><b>Fear: a wrong signed number</b>"]
    A["CA Anjali &mdash; Bureau / channel<br/><i>Altitude: Portfolio</i><br/>Discharges it across<br/>~40 clients efficiently<br/><b>Fear: irrelevance + reputation</b>"]
    V["Vikram &mdash; Founder / CXO<br/><i>Altitude: Outcome</i><br/>Sees THAT it happened,<br/>off my desk; liability stays his<br/><b>Fear: liability</b>"]

    R -->|"supplies data"| M
    M -->|"reconciles inputs"| S
    S -->|"produces the file"| A
    A -->|"discharges across portfolio"| V

    F(["The statutory FILING, discharged<br/>&mdash; correctly and provably &mdash;<br/><b>the unit of delivery</b>"])

    R -.-> F
    M -.-> F
    S -.-> F
    A -.-> F
    V -.-> F

    N["Same job, five slices:<br/>get the obligation discharged<br/>with the least attention.<br/>A payslip-first product fractures them;<br/>a filing-first product aligns them."]
    F --- N

